**Implementing the Modification**

I'm now fully committed to the chosen `text-[11px]` font size. After re-reviewing `FishTank.tsx`, I've finalized the implementation. I've ensured a direct swap of `text-sm` with the new custom size, targeting the introductory text and its surrounding elements. The changes are now ready to be committed, aligning with the "minimalistic design" goal and significantly improving text fit within the interface. I'm satisfied with the results of this adjustment.


**Refining the Implementation**

I'm presently focused on the final refinements to the font size implementation in `FishTank.tsx`. I've reevaluated the code, and I'm ensuring the changes are applied consistently across the target elements. I've reconfirmed the positioning of the `text-[11px]` declaration. I am confident that these final adjustments will deliver optimal results for the improved text fit and minimalistic design objectives.

